  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>In late-September 2023, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:  &nbsp; </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>Your <a href=\"https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/t5/azure-sql-blog/your-max-log-rate-on-sql-managed-instance-business-critical-is/ba-p/3899817\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">max log rate on SQL Managed Instance Business Critical</a> is now doubled.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>You can now <a href=\"https://aka.ms/mi-s3-restore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">restore backups</a> from Amazon S3 to Azure SQL Managed Instance. &nbsp;</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "In late-September 2023, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:\n\nYour max log rate on SQL Managed Instance Business Critical is now doubled.\n\nYou can now restore backups from Amazon S3 to Azure SQL Managed Instance."
  },
